  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "MCP server for Newsletter Sponsor Tracker. Find who sponsors a newsletter, or which newsletters a brand sponsors, from public Substack, beehiiv, and RSS archives: sponsor, domain, placements, and issue links. Runs on Apify. Clay-ready output.",
